.Dd August 25, 2026
.Dt DEVSTAT 3lua
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm devstat
.Nd Lua bindings for
.Xr devstat 3
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Bd -literal
devstat = require('devstat')
.Ed
.Pp
.Bl -tag -width XXXX -compact
.It Dv numdevs, errmsg = devstat.getnumdevs([kvm ] )
.It Dv generation, errmsg = devstat.getgeneration([kvm ] )
.It Dv version, errmsg = devstat.getversion([kvm ] )
.It Dv ok, errmsg = devstat.checkversion([kvm ] )
.It Dv statinfo, errmsg, errcode = devstat.getdevs([kvm ] )
.It Dv metrics, errmsg = devstat.compute_statistics(current[ , previous ] )
.It Dv etime = devstat.compute_etime(cur_time[ , prev_time ] )
.El
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
module provides bindings for Device Statistics Library
.Pq libdevstat
function calls.
.Pp
Where structures or functions deal with
.Vt long double
values, they are coerced to/from
.Vt double
precision Lua numbers.
.Bl -tag -width XXXX
.It Dv numdevs, errmsg = devstat.getnumdevs([kvm ] )
Wraps
.Xr devstat_getnumdevs 3 .
.It Dv generation, errmsg = devstat.getgeneration([kvm ] )
Wraps
.Xr devstat_getgeneration 3 .
.It Dv version, errmsg = devstat.getversion([kvm ] )
Wraps
.Xr devstat_getversion 3 .
.It Dv ok, errmsg = devstat.checkversion([kvm ] )
Wraps
.Xr devstat_checkversion 3 .
.It Dv statinfo, errmsg, errcode = devstat.getdevs([kvm ] )
Wraps
.Xr devstat_getdevs 3 ,
returning a
.Vt userdata
wrapper around the
.Vt struct statinfo *
handle.
.It Dv metrics, errmsg = devstat.compute_statistics(current[ , previous ] )
Wraps
.Xr devstat_compute_statistics 3 ,
returning a
.Vt table
of all the metrics.
.It Dv etime = devstat.compute_etime(cur_time[ , prev_time ] )
Wraps
.Xr devstat_compute_etime 3 ,
accepting an
.Vt integer
seconds
or
.Vt table
pair of
.Vt integer
seconds and nanoseconds for both time parameters.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Check the kernel
.Xr devstat 9
version:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
local devstat = require('devstat')

assert(devstat.checkversion())
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr devstat 3 ,
.Xr geom 3lua ,
.Xr devstat 9
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Ryan Moeller
